			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">each person who is known by us to be the beneficial owner of more than five percent (5%) of our issued and outstanding shares of common stock;</p>
			</td>
		</tr>

</tbody></table>

