<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 1pt;">(1)&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;According to a Schedule 13G filed with the SEC on February 14, 2025&#160;by Mr. Cushner, Mr.&#160;Cushner is deemed to beneficially own 809,312&#160;shares of common stock held in client accounts over which he holds discretionary authority.</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 1pt;">&#160;</p>

