			<p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">Amounts shown in this column do not reflect dollar amounts actually received by our named executive officers. Instead, these amounts reflect the aggregate grant date fair value of each restricted stock unit award computed in accordance with the provisions of FASB ASC Topic 718 (using the closing price of our common stock on the date of grant). Assumptions used in the calculation of these amounts are included in Note 13, Stockholders&#8217; Equity, of our audited consolidated financial statements for the year ended December 31, 2024.</p>
